  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-e9f37700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-e7174610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-046d1d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out the frying pan then return to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• In the last 2 minutes of cook time, sprinkle over the peri-peri seasoning, turning plant-based crumbed chicken to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-fc71b230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While chicken is cooking, microwave pita bread on a microwave-safe plate for 1 minute, until warmed through.\n• Halve pita bread and fill with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake pita bread directly on a wire oven rack until heated through and cheese is melted, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-0f7cb240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine rocket leaves and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Slice plant-based chicken.\n• Fill pita bread with rocket, Peri-Peri chick'n and caramelised onions.\n• Serve with fries and smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85626cade9b9f0ace588c/step-b0b13e50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
